  "description": {
    "text": "Each Happy Meal held one of these 12 holo cards of Pokémon from the Alola region of Pokémon Sun and Moon. The promotion ran in Australia in July and August 2017, in Europe in September and October, in the United States from 7 November to 4 December with toys of Pikachu, Rowlet, Litten, Popplio, Grubbin, Yungoos, Solgaleo and Lunala, and in the United Kingdom from 3 January to 6 February 2018.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "PocketMonsters.net: McDonalds Happy Meal - November 2017",
        "url": "https://pocketmonsters.net/forum/thread/6439"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokumon: Pikachu (5/12, McDonald's 2017)",
        "url": "https://pokumon.com/card/pikachu-5-12-mcdonalds-mcdonalds-collection-3/"
      }
    ]
  },
